Greetings Mr. Epstein,

Photographs of work by 'gala's crew, as per your directive, for your review and comments:

Main Driveway:
       - Driveway Maintenance and prep for new plants
       - New Palm planted in center planter
Palm Trees:
   -    Newly planted Palms are braced and anchored with 2 x 4 lumber
   -    1 year and older palms are anchored with ropes to concrete footing
Hillside below road to Kite House Flagpole :
   -    Equipment to be repaired to finalize rocks removal in preparation for hydroseeding
   -    Raise landscape to red marks on trees and dog shed



Respectfully submitted,
lituan



